                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is painfully cryptic simply for the sake of being cryptic. I like the experimentation and world, but the controls, combat, vehicle physics and everything else, has aged poorly. The vehicle suspension feels like it's made out of Jaffa cakes. The reviews are definitely misleading, and I assume they are based on nostalgia, alone. I'm all for 90's games and I have a high tolerance for outdated game mechanics, but this one is simply too annoying to power through. The constant jumping, rolling over and getting stuck on terrain is seriously aggravating. You have been warned...",
